    <abstract id="aspace_f40430614096e3a8dc7fd902b031ec43" label="Abstract">W.T. McFie Well Supply Company provided drilling tools used by most of the early petroleum industry operators in the Los Angeles basin. The collection includes ledgers, inventories, and account books.</abstract>
